---
title: "create_price_infos_hot_potato (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: state::assert_latest_only(pyth_state)
    q_version --> q_init: price_updates = empty vector
    q_init --> q_outer_check: len(verified_vaas) != 0
    q_outer_check --> q_pop_vaa: true
    q_outer_check --> q_finalize: false
    q_pop_vaa --> q_validate_src: cur_vaa = pop_back(verified_vaas)
    q_validate_src --> q_abort: false, abort E_INVALID_DATA_SOURCE
    q_validate_src --> q_deser: true, is_valid_data_source
    q_deser --> q_inner_check: price_infos = batch_attestation::deserialize(payload, clock)
    q_inner_check --> q_pop_info: len(price_infos) != 0
    q_inner_check --> q_outer_check: len(price_infos) == 0
    q_pop_info --> q_push: cur = pop_back(price_infos)
    q_push --> q_inner_check: push_back(price_updates, cur)
    q_finalize --> [*]: return hot_potato_vector::new(price_updates)

    note right of q_validate_src
        INV-001: each VAA must originate from a registered data source
        INV-002: returned HotPotatoVector must be consumed in same transaction
        INV-003: all verified_vaas must be processed and destroyed
    end note
